              <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Chá»n profile chung Ä‘á»ƒ phÃ¢n tÃ­ch stream-copy / encode Â· Chá»n video hoáº·c queue cue rá»“i nháº¥n Delete Ä‘á»ƒ xÃ³a.</p>
            </div>
            <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
